libyaml 0.2.5   https://github.com/yaml/libyaml     (MIT)
Vendored unmodified. Do not edit; upgrade by replacing the files.
build.zig compiles it and translates yaml.h for src/harness/yaml.zig. It is
the only C in arx: Zig's standard library has no YAML parser, and libyaml
gives the line numbers that error messages need.
